{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/guxdml","slideIndex":1,"text":"博通主要做兩種生意：半導體和企業軟體。第三季的收入裡，半導體大約七成，軟體大約三成。今天要聊的專用 AI 晶片，就在半導體這一塊。這些晶片照客戶的需求設計，也就是客製化晶片。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/y9pcty","slideIndex":2,"layout":{"id":"ly/fuhorq9g","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 3","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/bmdsri5s","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"第3頁全新紙感墨線主圖"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/cnmtknmd","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"原始品牌貓頭鷹"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/y9pcty","slideIndex":2,"text":"博通在這類合作裡，負責幫客戶把設計變成真正的晶片。客戶主導需求和設計，博通幫忙做到能交給工廠製造的階段。這讓科技公司能找外部夥伴，一起開發自己要用的晶片。已經有輝達的產品可以買，這些公司還願意自己做，背後最直接的原因就是成本。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/km5m8e","slideIndex":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/fuhorq9g","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 4","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/ojahcri9","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"第4頁全新紙感墨線主圖"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/3i10361o","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"原始品牌貓頭鷹"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/km5m8e","slideIndex":3,"text":"科技公司想降低的，是 AI 每天運作的成本。使用者每次請 AI 回答問題、整理文章，都會產生運算費用。用的人愈多，晶片和電力的花費也愈大。每次服務就算只省下一點，乘上龐大的使用量，長期下來也會差很多。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/weo71u","slideIndex":4,"layout":{"id":"ly/fuhorq9g","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 5","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/fq9436h4","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"第5頁全新紙感墨線主圖"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/0ri5crip","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"原始品牌貓頭鷹"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/weo71u","slideIndex":4,"text":"客製化晶片的目標，就是用同樣的設備和電力，完成更多運算。公司知道自己的 AI 最常做哪些工作，就能照這些工作調整設計，降低每次服務的成本。每天要處理的工作愈多，這種效率改善帶來的節省就愈可觀。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/6xkg90","slideIndex":5,"layout":{"id":"ly/fuhorq9g","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 6","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/c7adkz65","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":399.45,"top":126.85,"width":1480.44,"height":826.29},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"第6頁全新紙感墨線主圖"}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/b61cbupk","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":114.6,"top":678.63,"width":314.41,"height":293.37},"fit":"contain","name":"","alt":"原始品牌貓頭鷹"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/6xkg90","slideIndex":5,"text":"自己做晶片划不划算，關鍵在使用量夠不夠大。設計晶片、調整軟體，都得先花一筆開發費。後面用得夠多、每次運算省得夠多，才有機會把這筆投入收回來。大型科技公司有龐大的運算需求，也比較有條件投入這門生意。"}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/auh566","slideIndex":6,"layout":{"id":"ly/fuhorq9g","name":"Blank"},"title":"Slide 7","textShapes":0,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
